OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after BMW reverses into
OL,4,Athree people
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a BMW hit
OL,7,Fa parked car and then reversed into
OL,8,Fthree pedestrians in a city centre.
OL,10,FDurham Police said the driver was asked
OL,11,Fstop after being suspected of being on
OL,12,Fhis mobile phone, but failed to do so
OL,13,Fand hit a parked car on North Road,
OL,14,FDurham, on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,16,FThe pedestrians, a man, woman and
OL,17,F17-year-old boy, were taken to hospital
OL,18,Fwith non life-threatening injuries.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
