OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after BMW reverses into
OL,4,Athree people
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the BMW, a man in his
OL,7,F50s, was arrested at the scene on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of dangerous driving and
OL,9,Ftaken into custody where he remained,
OL,10,Fthe force said.
